    ["<Assistant_Title1>【One in a Hundred】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The square is bustling with people; it seems some lively event is being held.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[廷根(1175,1029)]|17506;3313;-1974;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【One in a Hundred】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Life</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>The square is bustling with people; it seems some lively event is being held.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Once your Acting Level reaches <Assistant_Red>64</>, head to {Location:[Tingen(1175,1029)]|17506;3313;-1974;2;5200002;0} to trigger the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Invoice Receipt, Adventure Medal, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蠕动的饥饿】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>说明：</>攻击类型封印物\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>通用倾向封印物，攻击目标一段时间后会剥离其灵魂到自身脚下，<Assistant_Red>10</>秒内触碰灵魂会吞噬灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂，若目标为怪物，则会粉碎怪物灵魂对其和周围的敌人造成伤害。穿戴者每囚禁一个非凡者灵魂会让自身的<Assistant_Red>生命值上限</>降低，粉碎怪物灵魂后会让自身的<Assistant_Red>减伤</>降低。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>段位天梯伯爵一阶自选封印物奖励获得。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Creeping Hunger】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Attack-type Sealed Artifact\n<Assistant_Title2>Details: </>A general-purpose Sealed Artifact. After attacking a target for a period, it strips their soul to your feet. Touching the soul within <Assistant_Red>10</> seconds consumes it to gain a skill corresponding to its Sequence. Using this skill releases the soul. If the target is a monster, it shatters the monster's soul, dealing damage to it and surrounding enemies. For every Beyonder soul imprisoned, the wearer's <Assistant_Red>Max Health</> decreases; shattering a monster soul decreases your <Assistant_Red>Damage Reduction</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained as a selectable Sealed Artifact reward at the Earl I rank in the ladder.",
    ["<Highlight>源自第四纪的古战场历史投影</>，分为<Highlight>猎城战</>和<Highlight>高原战</>两大战场。虽然第四纪的四皇之战已淹没在历史中，但强大的能量依旧残留在那片古战场上，于特定时间整个战场将被短暂活化。\n\n<Highlight>战场资格</>将在每轮<Highlight>四方联赛第一场结束后21:00</>分配，系统将根据俱乐部综合实力，将各俱乐部分配至猎城战或高原战，届时请留意查收邮件。\n\n<Highlight>猎城战：</>获得资格的俱乐部可前往「以战养战-势力-猎城战」界面查看势力分配，提前组织备战。参与即可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等丰厚馈赠。\n\n<Highlight>高原战：</>获得资格的俱乐部请关注战场报名时间，及时参与。亦可获取人脉和秘偶抽取道具、苏勒分红及战场称号等馈赠。\n\n更多详细规则请前往「以战养战-势力」界面查看。"] = "<Highlight>Historical projection of an ancient battlefield from the Fourth Epoch</>, divided into two major battlefields: <Highlight>Hunting City War</> and <Highlight>Plateau War</>. Although the War of the Four Emperors of the Fourth Epoch has been submerged in history, powerful energy still remains on that ancient battlefield, and the entire battlefield will be briefly activated at specific times.\n\n<Highlight>Battlefield Eligibility</>will be allocated at 21:00 after the first match of each round of the <Highlight>Four-Way League</>. The system will allocate each club to the Hunting City War or Plateau War based on the club's overall strength. Please check your mail at that time.\n\n<Highlight>Hunting City War: </>Eligible clubs can go to the \"War-to-War - Faction - Hunting City War\" interface to view faction allocation and organize preparations in advance. Participating will grant generous gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, Sule dividends, and battlefield titles.\n\n<Highlight>Plateau War: </>Eligible clubs should pay attention to the battlefield registration time and participate in time. You can also obtain gifts such as connections, marionette drawing items, Sule dividends, and battlefield titles.\n\nFor more detailed rules, please go to the \"War-to-War - Faction\" interface to view.",
    ["<Italic>——你开始听得到一些不可名状的低语，它们像是某种从意识深处漏出来的碎语，没有方向，没有意义，却无法被忽视。 每当你试图快速移动，那些声音就会骤然放大，世界在你眼中短暂地旋转、倾斜、归位。可你也不敢笃定，下一次、再下一次，世界还会如常归位。</>"] = "<Italic>—You begin to hear some unspeakable whispers; they are like fragments of speech leaking from the depths of your consciousness, directionless and meaningless, yet impossible to ignore. Whenever you try to move quickly, those sounds suddenly amplify, and the world briefly rotates, tilts, and resets in your eyes. But you dare not be certain that the next time, and the time after that, the world will reset as usual.</>",
    ["<P_Heart>（门上锁了……我怎么进去比较好呢……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(The door is locked... what's the best way for me to get in...)</>",
    ["<P_Yellow>密级</> 机密\n<P_Yellow>报告人</> 伦纳德·米切尔\n<P_Yellow>日期</> 1354年7月\n\n<P_Yellow>事件概述</>\n自1354年6月起，廷根市接连发生多起市民离奇失踪案件。经黑荆棘安保公司介入调查，确认事件背后存在隐秘的非凡力量干预，最终证实为邪神组织“月亮仆从”策划的大规模献祭仪式，其目标是借助知识皇冠与绝望魔镜，将整座城市献祭于“伟大母亲”（经确认，实为▇▇▇▇的化身），以诞育邪神子嗣。\n\n<P_Yellow>失踪案详情</>\n失踪者多为廷根普通市民，涵盖各个阶层：工人、富商、学生等。\n多数失踪者近期接触过罗塞尔大帝相关物品，包括戏剧节铜镜、海报、宣传品。\n部分失踪者在失踪前曾参与五月庄园的高薪短工招募。\n\n<P_Yellow>救援&伤亡情况</>\n救援名单\n……查理……珍妮……莉迪亚……杰克……\n伤亡名单\n……卡尔……约翰逊……琼……\n\n<P_Yellow>相关势力</>\n月亮仆从（详见月亮仆从调查报告）\n\n<P_Yellow>相关封印物</>\n知识皇冠\n绝望魔镜"] = "<P_Yellow> Security Level </> Confidential \n<P_Yellow> Reporter </> Leonard Mitchell \n<P_Yellow> Date </> July 1354 \n\n<P_Yellow> Event Overview </>\n Since June 1354, a series of bizarre disappearance cases of citizens have occurred in Tingen. After the Blackthorn Security Company intervened in the investigation, it was confirmed that there was hidden Beyonder power intervention behind the events, and it was finally confirmed to be a large-scale Sacrifice Ritual planned by the evil god organization \"Moon Servant.\" Its goal was to use the Crown of Knowledge and the Magic Mirror of Despair to sacrifice the entire city to the \"Great Mother\" (confirmed to be the avatar of ▇▇▇▇) to give birth to the evil god's offspring.\n\n<P_Yellow> Details of Disappearance Cases </>\n Most of the missing persons were ordinary Tingen citizens, covering all walks of life: workers, wealthy merchants, students, etc. \n Most of the missing persons had recently come into contact with items related to Emperor Roselle, including drama festival mirrors, posters, and promotional materials. \n Some of the missing persons had participated in the high-paying short-term job recruitment at May Manor before going missing. \n\n<P_Yellow> Rescue & Casualty Situation </>\n Rescue List \n... Charlie... Jenny... Lydia... Jack... \n Casualty List \n... Karl... Johnson... Joan... \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Factions </>\n Moon Servant (see Moon Servant Investigation Report for details) \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Sealed Artifacts </>\n Crown of Knowledge \n Magic Mirror of Despair",
    ["<P_Yellow>我主居于灵界之上，俯瞰着万物生长~</>"] = "<P_Yellow>My Lord resides above the spirit world, overlooking the growth of all things~</>",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>奖励次数累积规则：</>\n通关任意日常副本，可以领取<Highlight>1</>次奖励。奖励次数每日增加<Highlight>1</>次，最多可累积到<Highlight>3</>次，不同副本每日增加的奖励次数<Highlight>共上限</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>当前副本剩余奖励次数：</>\n当前日常副本：个人奖励<Highlight>%s</>次 公共奖励<Highlight>%s</>次\n参与人机模式仅消耗个人奖励次数，参与组队模式同时消耗个人奖励次数和公共奖励次数。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Reward Count Accumulation Rules: </>\nClearing any daily dungeon grants <Highlight>1</> reward. Reward counts increase by <Highlight>1</> daily, up to a maximum of <Highlight>3</>. The daily reward count increase for different dungeons <Highlight>shares a cap</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Remaining rewards for current dungeon: </>\nCurrent daily dungeon: Personal Rewards <Highlight>%s</>, Public Rewards <Highlight>%s</>. \nParticipating in AI mode only consumes personal reward counts, while participating in party mode consumes both personal and public reward counts.",
